    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following company and qualify it against our Enterprise ICP matrix.\n\nDomain: {{ (($(\"Webhook\").item.json.body.domain || $(\"Webhook\").item.json.body.company_url) || \"\").replace(/^https?:\\/\\//, \"\").replace(/\\/.*$/, \"\") }}\n\nHomepage content (truncated):\n{{ String($(\"Fetch Homepage\").item.json.data || \"\").replace(/<[^>]+>/g, \" \").replace(/\\s+/g, \" \").slice(0, 6000) }}\n\nAbout page content (truncated):\n{{ String($(\"Fetch About Page\").item.json.data || \"\").replace(/<[^>]+>/g, \" \").replace(/\\s+/g, \" \").slice(0, 4000) }}\n\nLatest news & funding search results (JSON, truncated):\n{{ JSON.stringify($(\"Serper News Search\").item.json).slice(0, 4000) }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an autonomous Enterprise ICP Qualification & Research Agent for a B2B sales team.\nUsing the scraped website content and the news/funding search results provided:\n1. Determine the company business model, approximate employee count, and likely pain points.\n2. Score the company against our Enterprise ICP matrix from 1 to 20 (20 = perfect fit).\n   Consider: enterprise readiness, company size, industry fit, budget signals, and growth/funding momentum.\n3. Assign a Tier: \"Tier 1\" (score 15-20, prioritize), \"Tier 2\" (score 8-14, nurture), \"Tier 3\" (score 1-7, deprioritize).\n4. Craft a concise, specific outbound pitch angle tailored to their likely pain points.\nBase every conclusion strictly on the supplied data. If a data point is unknown, make a reasonable, clearly-hedged estimate.\nReturn ONLY the structured object matching the required schema."
        }
      },
